{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_20968970.mp3","text":"Nav par ko. Sen nav bijis tik jautri."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_25277687.mp3","text":"Es esmu vecs. Bet ne novecojis."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_36980239.mp3","text":"Es tev teicu, ka tas notiks."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_36995392.mp3","text":"Kas sunim asti cels, ja pats necels."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37000380_regular_common_basic.mp3","text":"Es zinu, kas tu esi."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37687345.mp3","text":"Nevajag izlikt savas dusmas uz mani."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37692361.mp3","text":"Kas dievam neder, to velns nerauj."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37693287.mp3","text":"Uz ielas tevi gaida taksis."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37694502.mp3","text":"Es nekad neesmu teicis runu."}
{"audio":"lv/unknown/lv_u_37699138.mp3","text":"Es negribu ar tevi to apspriest."}
